# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# SECRETS & RUNTIME STATE — never commit these.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
config.json
provisioner.log
provisioner.success
*.log

# SSH keys, if anyone drops them in the repo folder by mistake.
# Covers modern OpenSSH defaults (ed25519/ecdsa) as well as RSA/DSA.
*.pem
*.key
id_rsa
id_dsa
id_ecdsa
id_ed25519
*_rsa
*_ecdsa
*_ed25519

# Whole credential directories, for the setup where ~/.oci and ~/.ssh are kept
# alongside the script instead of under the user profile (see README). The key
# files themselves are already covered above, but .oci/config is NOT a key and
# would otherwise be committed: it carries the tenancy OCID, user OCID, and API
# key fingerprint. Public keys and known_hosts aren't secret, but there's no
# reason to publish them either — ignore the directories wholesale.
.oci/
.ssh/

# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local AI-agent state & scratch notes — machine-specific, never ship.
# (Shared agent context lives in the tracked AGENTS.md instead.)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
.claude/
codex_peer_review*

# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editor / OS noise
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
